Subject: [TEST ONLY] drm/sched: adapt Aurora poisoned-storage/fence KUnit cases
Origin: https://github.com/aurora-silicon/linux/commit/0d1871c3cfde9cc45b8bc244dde4775dbf4e05c6
License: GPL-2.0 OR MIT (same as rust/kernel/drm/sched.rs)

Adapt the upstream test backend to Gravity's older JobImpl API. The test-only
NoHang enum value maps the existing C status. Factor constructor initialization
for poisoned-storage injection. No production driver behavior is changed here.
This patch is not part of the normal kernel package patch set.

--- a/rust/kernel/drm/sched.rs
+++ b/rust/kernel/drm/sched.rs
@@ -24,6 +24,9 @@
